{"id":"d_ex_armory_04","cat":"outpost","group":{"id":"outpost10801","label":"Armory"},"label":"Pawn Shop Women","stage":null,"prev":"d_ex_armory_03","next":"d_ex_armory_05","speakers":{"helm":"Helm","maxwell":"Maxwell","liter":"Liter","eunhwa":"Eunhwa","Narration":"Narration"},"icons":{"helm":"si_c352_00_s","maxwell":"si_c102_00_s","liter":"si_c082_00_s","eunhwa":"si_c092_00_s","Narration":"si_c999_00_s"},"notes":["Unlock: Helm · Eunhwa · Liter · Maxwell","Featuring Helm · 1 stamina · Reward: Darling for a Day ×1"],"lines":[{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_1","text":"Is there something that looks similar?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Armory","bgArt":"armory","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_girlstalk","movie":null,"shown":["helm","maxwell","liter"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_2","text":"Hmm... For now, it doesn't really seem like it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_3","text":"That's why you need to be sure of the material.\nJust look at it. It's clearly hand-made.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_4","text":"No, I've seen this gun before. I'm telling you, it came out of a factory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_5","text":"How can that be possible when it doesn't have a serial number?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_6","text":"Stop bickering, you two. Let's think this through.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_7","text":"Ahem...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_8","text":"Care to fill me in?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_9","text":"Oh, sorry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_10","text":"Someone donated a gun during the charity drive, and now Mast and Anchor don't know what to do with it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_11","text":"They took it to a gun shop, but they wouldn't accept it since it was the first time they said they'd seen anything like it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_12","text":"So we took it to a gun expert, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_13","text":"Hey look. Check out this steel wire, and the butt.\nThis is Missilis technology for sure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_14","text":"No way Missilis can make steel like this. This is Elysion, no doubt about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_15","text":"What do you know? How can you tell just by looking at it? Are you an expert?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_16","text":"Look who's talking! You're supposed to be a mechanic, but you can't even recognize what type of gun this is!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_17","text":"See? No one's saying anything now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_18","text":"If we could get access to a place with a variety of weapons, we might be able to compare it with them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_19","text":"That's easier said than done, however.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_20","text":"What are the chances it was hand-made?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_21","text":"That's impossible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_22","text":"Anyone who made their own weapons would be deported by the Central Government for breaking the law.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_23","text":"Not only that, where would they get the parts?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_24","text":"What are you doing? Who said you could come in?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["eunhwa"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_25","text":"Charming as always.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_26","text":"Oh, Eunhwa. Good thing you're here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_27","text":"Take a look at this gun.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_28","text":"It's a gun that was donated to Helm, but we can't make heads or tails of it. We're just trying to sell the darn thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_29","text":"We figured you might have an idea as to what it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_30","text":"Doubt it. What would she know? All she knows is how to shoot guns.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_32","text":"Where did you get this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_33","text":"It was a donation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_34","text":"From who?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_35","text":"I can't say.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_36","text":"Well, next time you see them, you should bow down and thank them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_37","text":"This is a model gun made by Alpha Tech.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_38","text":"... Did you say 'model gun'?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_39","text":"So it's just a toy? Then how come it's so intricate?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_40","text":"This is no 'toy'. It's a one-of-a-kind piece. Only 20 of them were made.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_41","text":"Don't take it for granted just because it's a model gun. The mechanism it uses was several years ahead of its time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_42","text":"It's for that very reason that it's so highly sought after by collectors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_43","text":"How much does it go for?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_44","text":"I'd say about 300 million credits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_45","text":"... Did you just say...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_46","text":"300 million?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_47","text":"... Are you sure?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_48","text":"Maybe even more than that, considering that it's in almost pristine condition.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_49","text":"I've got half a mind to buy it myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_50","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_51","text":"I know plenty of people who would be interested in this. You'll make more if you put this up for auction.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_52","text":"I'll introduce you to them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_armory_04_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_armory_04_53","text":"No, it's okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"i